    {
        "content": "<p>Here:</p>\n<div class=\"codehilite\" data-code-language=\"Lean4\"><pre><span></span><code><span class=\"kn\">syntax</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"s2\">\"struct \"</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">declId</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">ppIndent</span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"n\">optDeclSig</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">«</span><span class=\"kn\">extends</span><span class=\"bp\">»?</span><span class=\"o\">)</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"s2\">\" where \"</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"n\">structCtor</span><span class=\"o\">)</span><span class=\"bp\">?</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">structFields</span><span class=\"o\">)</span><span class=\"bp\">?</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">optDeriving</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">command</span>\n\n<span class=\"kn\">macro_rules</span>\n<span class=\"bp\">|</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">`</span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"n\">struct</span><span class=\"bp\">%$</span><span class=\"n\">tk</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">$</span><span class=\"n\">id</span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"n\">declId</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">$</span><span class=\"n\">sig</span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"n\">optDeclSig</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">$</span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"n\">e?</span><span class=\"o\">)</span><span class=\"bp\">?</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">$</span><span class=\"o\">[</span><span class=\"kn\">where</span><span class=\"bp\">%$</span><span class=\"n\">tk2</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">$</span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"n\">ctor?</span><span class=\"o\">)</span><span class=\"bp\">?</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">$</span><span class=\"n\">fields</span><span class=\"o\">]?</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">$</span><span class=\"n\">d</span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"n\">optDeriving</span><span class=\"o\">)</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">=&gt;</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"bp\">`</span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"kn\">structure</span><span class=\"bp\">%$</span><span class=\"n\">tk</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">$</span><span class=\"n\">id</span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"n\">declId</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">$</span><span class=\"n\">sig</span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"n\">optDeclSig</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">$</span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"n\">e?</span><span class=\"o\">)</span><span class=\"bp\">?</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">$</span><span class=\"o\">[</span><span class=\"kn\">where</span><span class=\"bp\">%$</span><span class=\"n\">tk2</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">$</span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"n\">ctor?</span><span class=\"o\">)</span><span class=\"bp\">?</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">$</span><span class=\"n\">fields</span><span class=\"o\">]?</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">$</span><span class=\"n\">d</span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"n\">optDeriving</span><span class=\"o\">)</span>\n</code></pre></div>\n<p>The syntax definition is modified from <a href=\"https://github.com/leanprover/lean4/blob/68218e876d2a38b1985b8590fff244a83c321783/src/Lean/Parser/Command.lean#L275-L281\">the parser for <code>structure</code></a></p>",
        "id": 604134347,
