    {
        "content": "<p>I guess</p>\n<div class=\"codehilite\" data-code-language=\"Lean4\"><pre><span></span><code><span class=\"kn\">syntax</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"s2\">\"struct \"</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">declId</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">ppIndent</span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"n\">optDeclSig</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">«</span><span class=\"kn\">extends</span><span class=\"bp\">»?</span><span class=\"o\">)</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">((</span><span class=\"s2\">\" where \"</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">&lt;|&gt;</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"s2\">\":=\"</span><span class=\"o\">)</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"n\">structCtor</span><span class=\"o\">)</span><span class=\"bp\">?</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">structFields</span><span class=\"o\">)</span><span class=\"bp\">?</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">optDeriving</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">command</span>\n\n<span class=\"kn\">macro_rules</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"bp\">|</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">`</span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"n\">struct</span><span class=\"bp\">%$</span><span class=\"n\">tk</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">$</span><span class=\"n\">id</span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"n\">declId</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">$</span><span class=\"n\">sig</span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"n\">optDeclSig</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">$</span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"n\">e?</span><span class=\"o\">)</span><span class=\"bp\">?</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">$</span><span class=\"o\">[</span><span class=\"kn\">where</span><span class=\"bp\">%$</span><span class=\"n\">tk2</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">$</span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"n\">ctor?</span><span class=\"o\">)</span><span class=\"bp\">?</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">$</span><span class=\"n\">fields</span><span class=\"o\">]?</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">$</span><span class=\"n\">d</span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"n\">optDeriving</span><span class=\"o\">)</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">=&gt;</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"bp\">`</span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"kn\">structure</span><span class=\"bp\">%$</span><span class=\"n\">tk</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">$</span><span class=\"n\">id</span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"n\">declId</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">$</span><span class=\"n\">sig</span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"n\">optDeclSig</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">$</span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"n\">e?</span><span class=\"o\">)</span><span class=\"bp\">?</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">$</span><span class=\"o\">[</span><span class=\"kn\">where</span><span class=\"bp\">%$</span><span class=\"n\">tk2</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">$</span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"n\">ctor?</span><span class=\"o\">)</span><span class=\"bp\">?</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">$</span><span class=\"n\">fields</span><span class=\"o\">]?</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">$</span><span class=\"n\">d</span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"n\">optDeriving</span><span class=\"o\">)</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"bp\">|</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">`</span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"n\">struct</span><span class=\"bp\">%$</span><span class=\"n\">tk</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">$</span><span class=\"n\">id</span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"n\">declId</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">$</span><span class=\"n\">sig</span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"n\">optDeclSig</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">$</span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"n\">e?</span><span class=\"o\">)</span><span class=\"bp\">?</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">$</span><span class=\"o\">[:=</span><span class=\"bp\">%$</span><span class=\"n\">tk2</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">$</span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"n\">ctor?</span><span class=\"o\">)</span><span class=\"bp\">?</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">$</span><span class=\"n\">fields</span><span class=\"o\">]?</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">$</span><span class=\"n\">d</span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"n\">optDeriving</span><span class=\"o\">)</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">=&gt;</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"bp\">`</span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"kn\">structure</span><span class=\"bp\">%$</span><span class=\"n\">tk</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">$</span><span class=\"n\">id</span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"n\">declId</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">$</span><span class=\"n\">sig</span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"n\">optDeclSig</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">$</span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"n\">e?</span><span class=\"o\">)</span><span class=\"bp\">?</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">$</span><span class=\"o\">[:=</span><span class=\"bp\">%$</span><span class=\"n\">tk2</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">$</span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"n\">ctor?</span><span class=\"o\">)</span><span class=\"bp\">?</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">$</span><span class=\"n\">fields</span><span class=\"o\">]?</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">$</span><span class=\"n\">d</span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"n\">optDeriving</span><span class=\"o\">)</span>\n</code></pre></div>\n<p>if you want to be complete but <code>structure A :=</code> is deprecated syntax.</p>",
